248
00:18:44,420 --> 00:18:45,980
I won't run away anymore!

249
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,420
You can trust me!

250
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:48,617
Please have mercy!

251
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:49,530
Just breathe!

252
00:18:49,613 --> 00:18:52,917
We aren't Dio's minions, and
we're certainly not vampires!

253
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:53,997
We're the good guys!

254
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:58,057
So just calm down and
let us help you you're

255
00:18:58,140 --> 00:19:03,197
good guys good guys
you're really not those

256
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:05,497
evil vampires you're
actually going to help

257
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:08,920
me get away from here
that's right we're good

258
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:20,877
real good at punching evil in the
face if you still want help we'll be

259
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:25,077
happy to oblige we'll I'll help by
sending you on a one-way trip to hell.

260
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:26,400
Sound good, Kaku-een?

261
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:31,750
Help!

262
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:34,440
Damn it! Help! Help me! Help!

263
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:37,820
How did you figure it out?

264
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:40,400
My power is impossible to crack!

265
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:42,597
Would this power have anything to do with

266
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:44,697
the face of a woman on
the back of your head?

267
00:19:44,780 --> 00:19:46,737
For future reference,
when you flip your head,

268
00:19:46,820 --> 00:19:49,349
you should make sure
your hands match, too.

269
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:53,700
Shit! You're right!

270
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:55,020
I never noticed!

271
00:19:55,180 --> 00:19:56,160
I'm an idiot!

272
00:19:56,580 --> 00:19:57,900
No, you're a loser.

273
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:00,840
Now where is Dio's room? Out with it.

274
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:03,557
Jotaro, try not to knock him unconscious.

275
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:04,934
He can take us to Dio.

276
00:20:06,360 --> 00:20:07,760
How dare you!

277
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:09,297
Don't you call me that!

278
00:20:09,380 --> 00:20:13,145
You're just like those other guys,
so you'll meet the same fate!

279
00:20:13,900 --> 00:20:15,140
I'll kill you!

280
00:20:15,420 --> 00:20:17,479
Lord Dio's powers made me immortal!

281
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:20,268
And I'll use all of it
to rip you to pieces!

282
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:27,237
So unless I heard wrong, you
just said you were an immortal.

283
00:20:27,320 --> 00:20:29,340
So you're a vampire like Dio.

284
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:31,260
In which case,

285
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:35,597
I can use you as a practice dummy for
when I fight against the real thing.

286
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:36,920
Oh my god!

287
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:50,717
So you really are immortal.

288
00:20:50,800 --> 00:20:52,140
Well, vampire or not,

289
00:20:52,300 --> 00:20:55,817
we can still rip you into little pieces
and scatter them around the room.

290
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:58,380
Well, are you taking us to Dio or not?

291
00:20:58,580 --> 00:21:00,060
The sun is about to set.

292
00:21:00,540 --> 00:21:04,220
Okay, but can I at
least ask you one thing?

293
00:21:04,780 --> 00:21:08,898
How the hell did you know the other
stand users used to call me loser?

294
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,720
Oh man, good grief.

295
00:21:21,060 --> 00:21:23,300
Thank you.

296
00:21:55,060 --> 00:21:57,100
Thank you.

297
00:22:49,260 --> 00:22:50,640
I gotta hand it to him.

298
00:22:51,180 --> 00:22:53,533
Um, Dio's got some pretty nice curtains.

299
00:22:57,360 --> 00:23:00,840
Alright, now I can walk and
even jump around if I need to.

300
00:23:01,360 --> 00:23:05,713
It still hurts a bit, but now's not
the time to worry about a little pain.

301
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:16,656
Greetings, Polareff.

302
00:23:16,780 --> 00:23:18,260
What a pleasant surprise.

303
00:23:20,720 --> 00:23:22,520
Dio, at last.

304
00:23:26,840 --> 00:23:28,620
You've finally come out, Dio.

305
00:23:28,840 --> 00:23:30,520
I knew this day would come.

306
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:32,520
I have absolutely no regrets.

307
00:23:32,820 --> 00:23:34,937
There's something you need to hear first.

308
00:23:35,020 --> 00:23:36,577
Is he playing games with us?

309
00:23:36,660 --> 00:23:38,542
When did he bring out his stand?

310
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:40,880
I'll give you a chance to rethink.
